<item>
<title>{3Virginia:</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14819</link>
<description>Played the game with this character, had a few fights until her level increased.. Then trained between this and a new game and found the variable.. Then 'poked' around to find which other variables are nearby. Noticed this character table repeated 4 times, once for each character.. So basically I had to just play the game a while to find out which table belonged to which character. Also, noticed that HP still went down in battles, so must be a separate battle HP var, so trained for it in battles and found it.</description>
